      "tr": "Farkları bir listede topla: `misses.append(abs(sample.mean() - true_mean))`.",
      "en": "Collect the misses in a list: `misses.append(abs(sample.mean() - true_mean))`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Her turda yeni üreteç: `rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)` döngünün içinde.",
      "en": "A new generator each round: `rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)` inside the loop."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef average_miss(values, n, repeats):\n    values = np.array(values, dtype=float)\n    true_mean = values.mean()\n    misses = []\n    for seed in range(repeats):\n        rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n        sample = rng.choice(values, size=n, replace=False)\n        misses.append(abs(sample.mean() - true_mean))\n    return round(float(np.mean(misses)), 3)\n\n\nvalues = list(range(1, 101))\nprint(average_miss(values, 4, 500))\nprint(average_miss(values, 16, 500))\nprint(average_miss(values, 64, 500))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef average_miss(values, n, repeats):\n    values = np.array(values, dtype=float)\n    true_mean = values.mean()\n    misses = []\n    for seed in range(repeats):\n        rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n        sample = rng.choice(values, size=n, replace=False)\n        misses.append(abs(sample.mean() - true_mean))\n    return round(float(np.mean(misses)), 3)\n\n\nvalues = list(range(1, 101))\nprint(average_miss(values, 4, 500))\nprint(average_miss(values, 16, 500))\nprint(average_miss(values, 64, 500))\n```"
    }
